# Multi-Repo Architecture Rules

1. `iamsaquib8/stockwise`: Public MIT-licensed terminal, TUI, and MCP server. Contains zero raw exchange data, zero proprietary model weights, and zero hardcoded cloud keys.
2. `iamsaquib8/stockwise-pool`: Private point-in-time quant research data lake. Only exports `<200 KB` statistical distributions (`strategy_benchmarks.json`) and quantized model weights (`model_card.json`). Never commit raw OHLCV bars.
3. `iamsaquib8/stockwise-slm`: Private in-house SLM training and dataset curation. Emits GGUF and ONNX models.
4. `iamsaquib8/stockwise-pro`: Private statutory tax form engines and CPA/CA audit workpapers.
5. `iamsaquib8/stockwise-hub`: Private offline-first Ed25519 licensing and default AI gateway.
